":"அன்னே","parts":[{"text":"அன்னே","lemma":"அன்னன்","gloss":"he is like that"}],"gloss":"he is like that"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அன்னன்","parts":[{"text":"அன்னன்","lemma":"அன்னன்","gloss":"such a person"}],"gloss":"such a person"},{"surface":"ஆகலின்","parts":[{"text":"ஆகு","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"become"},{"text":"அலின்","lemma":"அலின்","gloss":"because of"}],"gloss":"because of being"},{"surface":"எந்தை","parts":[{"text":"எந்தை","lemma":"எந்தை","gloss":"my lord/father"}],"gloss":"my lord"},{"surface":"உள்ளடி","parts":[{"text":"உள்","lemma":"உள்","gloss":"inner"},{"text":"அடி","lemma":"அடி","gloss":"foot"}],"gloss":"sole of the foot"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"முள்ளும்","parts":[{"text":"முள்","lemma":"முள்","gloss":"thorn"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even a thorn"},{"surface":"நோவ","parts":[{"text":"நோவ","lemma":"நோ","gloss":"to hurt"}],"gloss":"to hurt"},{"surface":"உற்றாக","parts":[{"text":"உற்றாக","lemma":"உறு","gloss":"may it experience"}],"gloss":"may it experience"},{"surface":"தில்ல","parts":[{"text":"தில்ல","lemma":"தில்ல","gloss":"particle of desire/optative"}],"gloss":"may it be so!"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஈவோர்","parts":[{"text":"ஈ","lemma":"ஈ","gloss":"give"},{"text":"வோர்","lemma":"வோர்","gloss":"those who"}],"gloss":"givers"},{"surface":"அரிய","parts":[{"text":"அரிய","lemma":"அரிய","gloss":"rare"}],"gloss":"rare"},{"surface":"இவ்","parts":[{"text":"இவ்","lemma":"இ","gloss":"this"}],"gloss":"this"},{"surface":"உலகத்து","parts":[{"text":"உலகத்து","lemma":"உலகம்","gloss":"of the world"}],"gloss":"of the world"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வாழ்வோர்","parts":[{"text":"வாழ்","lemma":"வாழ்","gloss":"live"},{"text":"வோர்","lemma":"வோர்","gloss":"those who"}],"gloss":"those who live"},{"surface":"வாழ","parts":[{"text":"வாழ","lemma":"வாழ","gloss":"may they flourish"}],"gloss":"may they flourish"},{"surface":"அவன்","parts":[{"text":"அவன்","lemma":"அவன்","gloss":"his"}],"gloss":"his"},{"surface":"தாள்","parts":[{"text":"தாள்","lemma":"தாள்","gloss":"feet/effort"}],"gloss":"feet"},{"surface":"வாழியவே","parts":[{"text":"வாழியவே","lemma":"வாழி","gloss":"may they live long"}],"gloss":"may they live long!"}]}],"literal":"If one goes today, he will give, for a little while / if one waits and goes, he will give, later too / without saying \"I gave before\", having approached / even if one goes every day, without failing / as we desire, our empty vessel, he who fills / as he desires, his lord to rejoice / may he complete the difficult task, Koṟṟaṉ of the perfect spear / even if one desires angry bulls abundant in herds, along with the field / even if one desires a heap of paddy abundant on the threshing floor / even if one desires rare ornaments along with male elephants, the great-natured one / to others too, he is of such righteous nature / because he is such, my lord's sole of the foot / may even a thorn not hurt / in this world where givers are rare / so that those who live may flourish, may his feet live long!","translation":"If you go to him today, he will give within a moment. Even if you wait and go later, he will still give. Without ever saying, 'I have already given to you,' he never fails, even if approached every single day. He fills our empty vessels just as we desire. May Koṟṟaṉ of the flawless spear, who performs difficult deeds to please his own lord as he desires, complete his tasks! Whether one asks for a herd of angry bulls along with the field, or a heap of paddy from the threshing floor, or rare ornaments along with male elephants, that noble man is of such righteous nature to everyone. Because he is so generous, may not even a thorn hurt the soles of my lord's feet! In this world where true givers are rare, may his feet live long so that those who depend on him may flourish!","modern":"இன்று சென்றாலும் அவன் உடனே தருவான். சிறிது காலம் பொறுத்துச் சென்றாலும் பின்னரும் தருவான். 'முன்பே கொடுத்துவிட்டேனே' என்று கூறாமல், நாள்தோறும் சென்றாலும் பொய்க்காமல், நாம் விரும்பியவாறு நம்முடைய வறிய பாத்திரங்களை நிரப்புபவன் அவன். தன் தலைவன் மகிழுமாறு அவன் விரும்பிய அரிய செயல்களை முடிக்கும் திருந்திய வேலைக் கொண்ட கொற்றன், கூட்டமாக இருக்கும் சினமுடைய எருதுகளையும் நிலத்தையும் கேட்டாலும், களம் நிறைந்த நெற்குவியலைக் கேட்டாலும், அரிய அணிகலன்களையும் ஆண் யானைகளையும் கேட்டாலும், பிறருக்கும் அவ்வாறே கொடுக்கும் அறப்பண்பு உடையவன். அத்தகைய கொடையாளியாகிய என் தலைவனுடைய உள்ளங்காலில் ஒரு முள் கூட தைத்து நோகாமல் இருக்கட்டும். கொடையாளிகள் அரிதாக உள்ள இவ்வுலகில், இரப்போர் வாழ அவனது தாள் வாழ்க!","explanation":"The poet Kāviripūmpaṭṭiṉattu Kārikkaṇṇaṉār is praising the chieftain Piṭṭaṅkoṟṟaṉ. He extols the boundless generosity and loyalty of the chieftain, describing how he never turns away anyone, giving generously day after day without hesitation. He is equally loyal to his own king, executing difficult tasks to please him. The poet wishes that no harm, not even a tiny thorn, should hurt the feet of such a noble giver. Key words include 'வறுங்கலம் நிறைப்போன்' (he who fills empty vessels), 'அறத்தகை' (righteous nature), and 'தாள் வாழியவே' (may his feet live long).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.9],[0.9,1.3],[1.3,1.5],[1.5,2.3],[2.3,2.7],[2.7,3.1],[3.1,3.5],[3.5,4.4],[4.4,4.9],[5.07,5.4],[5.4,5.7],[5.7,6.6],[6.6,6.8],[6.8,7.37],[7.51,7.8],[8.23,8.67],[8.67,9.1],[9.1,9.1],[9.1,10.7],[10.7,11.56],[11.56,11.97],[12.33,12.46],[12.46,13.65],[13.65,15.55],[15.55,15.55],[15.55,15.55],[15.55,16.5],[16.5,16.5],[16.5,16.5],[16.5,16.5],[16.5,17.6],[18.48,19.08],[19.08,19.48],[19.48,19.58],[19.58,19.78],[19.78,21.48],[21.48,21.58],[21.58,22.08],[22.08,22.48],[22.48,22.7],[22.7,22.76],[22.76,22.98],[23.42,24.74],[25.18,26.08],[26.08,26.38],[26.38,26.78],[26.78,26.88],[26.88,27.35],[27.35,27.35],[27.35,28.51],[28.51,29.28],[29.58,30.18],[30.18,30.61],[30.63,30.68],[30.68,31.98],[31.98,32.28],[32.28,32.48],[32.48,32.68],[32.68,32.98]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.9],[0.9,1.4],[1.4,1.6],[1.6,2.5],[2.5,2.9],[2.9,3.3],[3.3,3.8],[3.8,4.15],[4.33,5.2],[5.2,5.8],[5.8,5.8],[5.8,7